# Admin > Retention: stores, retention limits, sweeper status and log rotation.
# These are configurable controls; whether a configuration meets a given law is for the operator to decide.

admin-retention-title = Retention and log rotation
admin-retention-intro = How long each store keeps personal and behavioural data, and how server log files rotate. A daily sweep deletes rows older than the limits below. These are configurable controls; they do not by themselves make a deployment compliant with any law.
admin-retention-docs = Each store, what it holds and what removes it is listed in docs/admin/retention.md.
